            'The Kroll Opera House (23 March 1933): With the Reichstag in ruins, deputies convened under massive swastika banners ringed by armed SS and SA guards. Intimidation and backroom deals secured the two-thirds majority required to pass the Enabling Act, ending parliamentary democracy.',
