              text: 'It is with burning anxiety and with mounting dismay that We have followed the path of the Church, and witnessed the progressive oppression of the faithful... Whoever exalts race, or the people, or the State, or a particular form of State, or the depositories of power, or any other fundamental value of the human community—however necessary and honourable their function in worldly things—whoever raises these notions above their standard value and divinizes them to an idolatrous level, distorts and perverts an order of the world planned and created by God... We have spared no effort to protect the sanctity of the solemn pledge given to Us in the Concordat; but the other party has made the contract a mockery, unmasking a war of extermination against the Church.',
