            'Statute establishing compulsory sterilization and Genetic Health Courts, signed by Adolf Hitler and Interior Minister Wilhelm Frick, 14 July 1933.',
          desc: 'Extract from the compulsory sterilization statute published in the Reichsgesetzblatt, July 1933.',
