          act: 4,
          text: "<p><span class=\"para-ref\">[4.1]</span> Beyond youth groups, state schooling was converted into an instrument of totalitarian indoctrination. In 1934, Bernhard Rust became Education Minister, announcing that the goal of education was creating fanatical National Socialists. Schoolteachers underwent strict political vetting; Jewish and socialist educators were dismissed, while all remaining teachers were forced to join the National Socialist Teachers' League (NSLB) and swear an oath to Hitler. By 1937, 97 percent of teachers had joined, attending mandatory ideological holiday camps.</p>\n\n<p><span class=\"para-ref\">[4.2]</span> The academic curriculum was rewritten to reflect Nazi ideology and militarism. History glorified Germanic victories, the 'stab-in-the-back' myth, and Weimar treachery. Biology was replaced by 'racial science' (Rassenkunde), teaching pupils to classify Aryan superiority through skull measurements while dehumanizing Jews. Physical education expanded to 15 percent of school hours to harden pupils for combat, while mathematics problems incorporated bomb trajectory calculations and the economic cost of caring for hereditary psychiatric patients.</p>",
