            'Hermann Göring (1893–1946): Appointed Plenipotentiary for the Four-Year Plan in October 1936, Göring took absolute dictatorial control over the German economy, prioritizing rapid rearmament, autarky, and synthetic materials over civilian living standards, famously proclaiming: "Guns will make us powerful; butter will only make us fat."',
